n was considered one of  westeros's fastest Dragons by 75 AC  easily beating terraxis and vegar in  speed but she had grown in Dolan and  lazy by 129 AC around 50 years later yet  she was still terrifyingly fast when  awakened being of old age as well as big  of size she was wise and experienced in  combat so that is why Queen Alison tried  to negotiate with Princess rhaenys to  join her side since she knew that if the  she Dragon melees was to be on the side  of the blacks there would be quite a bit  of an advantage for princess rhaenera to  get the iron throne  the blacks already have curraxis Cyrax  sea smoke Moon Dancer Eric's Vermax and  probably Verma Thor and Silverwing at  that point of time while the greens only  have three with Vega being the only one  of strategic significance and while  Sunfire is of fighting size he is still  small smaller than Cyrax or even caraxis  and sea smoke the dragon dream fire  while a formidable Beast lacks a  competing writer since Helena is often  lost in her own world and that is why  princess rhaenys was locked in her  Chambers fearing that if she joined the  blacks all hell would be let loose  so now we'll mainly see battle in the  dance and if so with what dragon or  dragons  as of season 1 we will not be seeing her  in action anymore aside from the  breakout from the dragon pit from this  previous episode if the series follows  the book religiously with a few minor  creative Independence which is quite  often seen in any series  so the next season will have melees  facing off against vegar herself and  also against Sunfire with the results of  the battle up to you to find out we  won't be spotting that much so I hope  you have enjoyed watching this video do  hit the like button for support and  subscribe but most of all smash that  Bell icon for regular updates on new  videos right here on this channel till  the next one take care fam

